# Build artifacts. The Rust core, its Swift bindings and the Xcode project are
# all generated (tools/build-core.sh, xcodegen), so none of them is committed —
# a checked-in copy of a generated file is one that goes stale unnoticed.
Generated/
GliphCore.xcframework/
Gliph.xcodeproj/
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
